    "preamble": "Ut Of Chandigarh vs Jaspal Garg on 27 November, 2025 Crm-A-16-Ma-2008 (O&M) -1- In The High Court Of Punjab & Haryana At Chandigarh 140 Crm-A-16-Ma-2008 (O&M) Date of decision: 27.11.2025 Union Territory, Chandigarh ...Applicant(s) Versus Jaspal Garg ... Respondent(s) Coram : Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Vinod S. Bhardwaj Present :- Mr. N.K. Vashist, Addl. P.P. for U.T. Chandigarh, for the applicant-appellant. Vinod S. Bhardwaj, J. (Oral) The present application has been preferred under Section 378(3) of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 (hereinafter 'Cr.P.C.') seeking grant of leave to appeal against the judgment of acquittal dated 31.07.2007 passed by the Chief Judicial Magistrate, Chandigarh, in a case stemming from Pfa Case bearing No.165 dated 28.11.1997 filed under Sections 7(i), 2 (ia) (j) read with Section 16(1)(a)(i) and 16(1-A)9(i) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954.",
